### Manual cases for the day's logistics (turnos, clients, route and fuel).
### Web: JWT + admin. Bot: x-api-key + the phone of an admin user.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE
@botKey = PASTE_BOT_API_KEY_HERE
@telefono = PASTE_ADMIN_PHONE_HERE

### 1) Logistics of today  -  [Expect 200, data.turnos / clientes_a_visitar / ruta / combustible]
GET {{base}}/logistica/dia
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2) Logistics of a specific day  -  [Expect 200]
GET {{base}}/logistica/dia?fecha=2026-10-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Invalid date format  -  [Expect 400]
GET {{base}}/logistica/dia?fecha=20/10/2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Date that does not exist  -  [Expect 400]
GET {{base}}/logistica/dia?fecha=2026-02-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Without token  -  [Expect 401]
GET {{base}}/logistica/dia

### 6) Bot (WhatsApp, staff): same data plus a ready-to-send `mensaje`  -  [Expect 200]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/logistica
x-api-key: {{botKey}}

### 7) Bot with a specific day  -  [Expect 200]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/logistica?fecha=2026-10-20
x-api-key: {{botKey}}

### 8) Bot with a phone that is not staff  -  [Expect 404]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/5490000000000/logistica
x-api-key: {{botKey}}

### 9) Bot without the API key  -  [Expect 401]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/logistica
